<title>SOUTH AFRICA: AECI yr shr up 7.8 pct, div up 8.4 pct.</title>
<headline>AECI yr shr up 7.8 pct, div up 8.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     275	vs    255</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  90	vs     83</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   426	vs    395</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   492	vs    442</p>
<p>    Tax			 343	vs    296</p>
<p>    Financing costs	 242	vs    203</p>
<p>    Turnover		7,506	vs  6,705</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	  118	vs    --</p>
<p>Full name: AECI Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had called for earnings per share of 278.2 cents per share with the range 277 to 280 cents, while the dividend was forecast at 89.2 cents with the range 85 to 92.5 cents a share.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
